        "system": {
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>One feather quill supplied continuously with a single ordinary ink type, enough for uninterrupted writing without dripping. A special-ink version requires five vials of that ink when crafted. This component is the magical CL 1 Creation quill; the separately tracked metal carrying case is mundane.</p>",
            "instructions": "<p>One quill is bundled, not three. Its eighty-gp listed package value is allocated here; the supplied case adds no separate value. Weight is negligible. Remove and use this quill independently without duplicating its case or inventing free special inks.</p>",
